Standalone mode origin — lib/storage/src/dispatcher.rs:25-46: Dispatcher::new sets consensus_state: None; only with_consensus() sets Some. consensus_proposal_sender in ToC is likewise absent without consensus, so on any standalone deployment POST /cluster/recover deterministically reaches the service_error branch. No 'intentionally/by design' comment exists on the 500 path (bare absence of a 400 gate is not intent evidence).
